# Never commit real secrets. This directory holds only:
# - .gitignore (this enforcement)
# - README.md (the pattern)
# - secrets/<client-id>/*.env.age (age-encrypted env files — ciphertext
#   only, safe to commit)
# - *.example (plaintext templates with fake values)
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.example
!*.age
# Allow per-client subdirectories (secrets/<client-id>/) so git descends
# into them; files inside are still ignored except *.age / *.example.
!*/
